#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Exit Repeat inside an If: wait up to 90 ms, leave early when the flag is set. The flag is never set here, so the loop runs its full time.
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 180,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Repeat For 90000 us
    If Flag = 1 Then
        Exit Repeat
    End If
    Wait 10 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
